# Reuse methods

- Inspect the project first. Reuse `Header`, `Text`, `theme`, `useApp`, storage helpers, and existing screens before creating new ones.
- Extract a shared function/hook when the same logic appears twice (playback, timers, formatters, permission requests).
- Put shared UI in `src/app/components` (or `src/components`), shared logic in hooks/services, shared shapes in `src/app/Types`.
- Do not duplicate types (one `Voice` type, used everywhere). Do not copy-paste player controls into every screen.
- Prefer a small reusable component over a large screen that inlines everything.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — playback copied into VoicePage and AddVoicePage
player.seekTo(0);
player.play();

// ✅ GOOD — one helper/hook used by both screens
await playFromStart(player);
```
